        "name": "AmandaLovesElon",
        "text": "✨️🚀Starlink saves lives, and this time it was right here in Britain. 🇬🇧✨️🚀\n\n🔥A walker fell into a hornets' nest down a steep bank in Cumbria. The rescuers had no mobile signal, but Starlink got the call through, and the walker is safe.\n\n✝️\"My help cometh from the LORD, which made heaven and earth.\" Psalm 121:2 (KJV)\n\nThank you @SpaceX @elonmusk 🙏\nImage: SpaceX",
