        "id": "2116806228663820548",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "The Atlantic",
        "text": "Elon Musk’s X has become the go-to place for MAGA supporters to hunt for examples of voter fraud, @WillOremus reports. He examines how the platform could play a central role in the midterm elections: https://www.theatlantic.com/technology/2026/10/x-midterm-election-ai-fact-check/689245/?taid=6ae6f50b1d3fbb0001703811&utm_campaign=the-atlantic&utm_content=edit-promo&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter",
